      "content": "seriously? what are you talking about? i'm in the middle of a production outage and i don't need a story about goblins or enchanted forests. just give me the actual technical checklist without the weird stuff. \n\nand regarding the resource issue, how do i actually verify if it's an OOMKill vs just some other kind of crash if the logs aren't showing anything specific?",
